 world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/cb209788d6fd90b33df716b6b1c5cbd9.poster.avif?t=1771408777\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/cb209788d6fd90b33df716b6b1c5cbd9.webm?t=1771408777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/cb209788d6fd90b33df716b6b1c5cbd9.mp4?t=1771408777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with your companion Goat Kid, solve environmental puzzles utilizing weather-controlling stellar-powers, and restore the constellations\u2019 stars back up to the sky.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/8bf9f7c24eb4b0e32fe0f40e75bcef86.poster.avif?t=1771408777\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/8bf9f7c24eb4b0e32fe0f40e75bcef86.webm?t=1771408777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/8bf9f7c24eb4b0e32fe0f40e75bcef86.mp4?t=1771408777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SHOOT FOR THE STARS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique weather-controlling gameplay: Utilize unlocked constellation stellar-powers by using your magical astrolabe to activate fallen stars, manipulate the weather\u2014summoning winds, calling down rain, and unleashing lightning to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/d9a4866ffcce44d9878e0e3f7f797f59.poster.avif?t=1771408777\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/d9a4866ffcce44d9878e0e3f7f797f59.webm?t=1771408777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/d9a4866ffcce44d9878e0e3f7f797f59.mp4?t=1771408777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ASTRONOMICAL ATMOSPHERE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover breathtaking landscapes inspired by the diverse beauty of real-life Arabian locales; vast deserts, towering rocky cliffs, blooming lush peninsulas, and even fiery volcanos.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/95dc7a41e8627194eee505285489ab56.poster.avif?t=1771408777\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/95dc7a41e8627194eee505285489ab56.webm?t=1771408777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539850/extras/95dc7a41e8627194eee505285489ab56.mp4?t=1771408777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HUNTRESS IN ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in bow and arrow combat to ward off dark entities that get in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_im